<title>GERMANY: German April wholesale prices up 0.2 m/m.</title>
<headline>German April wholesale prices up 0.2 m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE PRICES	 April 97  Mar	April 96</p>
<p> Mth-on-mth change		 0.2	0.8	 +0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change		   1.6	1.6	 -1.1</p>
<p> Index (adj, base 1991)	 105.2    105.0	103.5</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
